<view class="page">
  <view class="page-header">
    <view>
      <view class="page-title">个人薄弱点</view>
      <view class="page-subtitle">系统按除数范围自动分析你的错误率</view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" bindtap="refresh">重新分析</button>
  </view>

  <view class="alert alert-info section">
    系统按除数百位范围分析错误率；样本不足（少于 {{weakConfig.minSampleCount}} 题或错误少于 {{weakConfig.minErrorCount}} 题）时不会判定。当前强化出题占比 {{reinforcementRatio}}%。
  </view>

  <view class="tabs">
    <button
      wx:for="{{tabs}}"
      wx:key="key"
      class="tab {{tab === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}"
      data-key="{{item.key}}"
      bindtap="switchTab"
    >{{item.label}}</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{visiblePatterns.length === 0}}" class="empty">当前分类下没有薄弱点记录。</view>

  <view wx:for="{{visiblePatterns}}" wx:key="id" class="card section">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view class="card-title">除数 {{item.rangeMin}}–{{item.rangeMax}}</view>
      <text class="badge {{item.statusBadgeClass}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="stat-grid" style="margin-top: 16rpx">
      <view class="stat">
        <view class="stat-label">错误率</view>
        <view class="stat-value stat-value-sm">{{item.errorRateLabel}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="stat">
        <view class="stat-label">总体错误率</view>
        <view class="stat-value stat-value-sm">{{item.overallErrorRateLabel}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="stat">
        <view class="stat-label">样本</view>
        <view class="stat-value stat-value-sm">{{item.sampleCount}} 题</view>
      </view>
      <view class="stat">
        <view class="stat-label">强化权重</view>
        <view class="stat-value stat-value-sm">{{item.weightLabel}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="divider"></view>

    <view class="row-between text-sm">
      <text class="text-muted">最近趋势</text>
      <text class="bold {{item.trendClass}}">{{item.trendArrow}} {{item.trendLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row-between text-sm" style="margin-top: 8rpx">
      <text class="text-muted">最近窗口错误率</text>
      <text class="mono">{{item.recentErrorRateLabel}}（最近 {{item.recentSampleCount}} 题）</text>
    </view>

    <view class="text-sm text-muted" style="margin-top: 16rpx">{{item.suggestion}}</view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="margin-top: 16rpx" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="trainRange">训练薄弱范围</button>
  </view>
</view>
